          <text x="307" y="58" font-family="Arial" font-size="12.5" font-weight="700" fill="#0B1F3A" text-anchor="middle">Jedna lokalita</text>
          <text x="562" y="58" font-family="Arial" font-size="12.5" font-weight="700" fill="#0B1F3A" text-anchor="middle">Viac lokalít</text>
          <text x="34" y="235" font-family="Arial" font-size="12" font-weight="700" letter-spacing="2" fill="#0B1F3A" text-anchor="middle" transform="rotate(-90 34 235)">KAPACITA</text>
          <text x="150" y="150" font-family="Arial" font-size="12" font-weight="700" fill="#0B1F3A" text-anchor="middle">Konvenčná</text>
          <text x="150" y="165" font-family="Arial" font-size="12" font-weight="700" fill="#0B1F3A" text-anchor="middle">stačí</text>
          <text x="150" y="315" font-family="Arial" font-size="12" font-weight="700" fill="#0B1F3A" text-anchor="middle">Treba</text>
          <text x="150" y="330" font-family="Arial" font-size="12" font-weight="700" fill="#0B1F3A" text-anchor="middle">trunking</text>

          <rect x="180" y="72" width="255" height="158" rx="4" fill="#EAF2FF" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3"></rect>
          <text x="307" y="145" font-family="Arial" font-size="14" font-weight="700" fill="#0B1F3A" text-anchor="middle">Jednoduchá</text>
          <text x="307" y="164" font-family="Arial" font-size="14" font-weight="700" fill="#0B1F3A" text-anchor="middle">konvenčná sieť</text>

          <rect x="435" y="72" width="255" height="158" rx="4" fill="#1A1ADB" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3"></rect>
          <text x="562" y="155" font-family="Arial" font-size="15" font-weight="700" fill="#fff" text-anchor="middle">IP Site Connect</text>

          <rect x="180" y="230" width="255" height="158" rx="4" fill="#1A1ADB" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3"></rect>
          <text x="307" y="305" font-family="Arial" font-size="15" font-weight="700" fill="#fff" text-anchor="middle">Capacity Plus</text>
          <text x="307" y="324" font-family="Arial" font-size="12" fill="#dfe4fb" text-anchor="middle">(single-site)</text>

          <rect x="435" y="230" width="255" height="158" rx="4" fill="#0B1F3A" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3"></rect>
          <text x="562" y="305" font-family="Arial" font-size="15" font-weight="700" fill="#fff" text-anchor="middle">Capacity Plus</text>
          <text x="562" y="324" font-family="Arial" font-size="14" font-weight="700" fill="#fff" text-anchor="middle">Multi-Site</text>

          <text x="435" y="428" font-family="Arial" font-size="12.5" fill="#5b6677" text-anchor="middle">Pri veľkom rozsahu, redundancii a centrálnom riadení → zvážiť Capacity Max.</text>
        </svg>
        <figcaption class="text-sm text-muted px-6 pb-5 italic">
          Architektúra sa vyberá podľa dvoch osí: koľko vysielacích lokalít treba na pokrytie a či konvenčná kapacita
          zvláda súbeh hovorov. Capacity Plus Multi-Site bol predtým Linked Capacity Plus.<sup><a href="#z1">1</a></sup><sup
            ><a href="#z2">2</a></sup
          ><sup><a href="#z3">3</a></sup>
        </figcaption>
